# Test PALETTE and PALETTECOLOR commands
# Validates palette selection and individual color customization

# Test 1: Basic palette selection
PALETTE colodore
WAIT 100ms

# Test 2: Different palette
PALETTE pepto_ntsc
WAIT 100ms

# Test 3: Another palette variant
PALETTE vice_new
WAIT 100ms

# Test 4: Custom palette color - set background to black
PALETTECOLOR 0, 0, 0, 0
WAIT 100ms

# Test 5: Custom palette color - set white
PALETTECOLOR 1, 255, 255, 255
WAIT 100ms

# Test 6: Custom palette color - set blue
PALETTECOLOR 6, 0, 0, 170
WAIT 100ms

# Test 7: Custom palette color - set light blue  
PALETTECOLOR 14, 128, 192, 255
WAIT 100ms

# Test 8: Multiple color customizations in sequence
PALETTECOLOR 2, 255, 0, 0
PALETTECOLOR 5, 0, 255, 0
PALETTECOLOR 7, 255, 255, 0
WAIT 100ms

STOP
